  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Panos S Asia Media&amp;Peace - Panos South Asia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Panos S Asien Media&amp;Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att st&#xE4;rka medvetenheten inom media om roller f&#xF6;r att skapa ett klimat av fred i Indien och Pakistan. St&#xE4;rka kunskapen, f&#xF6;rst&#xE5;elsen och professionaliteten hos journalister och reportrar i Indien och Pakistan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the role of media in promoting cultures of peace in the Indo-Pak subcontinent. Raise awareness, stimulate and channel debate abut the roles of the media . Strengthen the skills, understanding and professionalism of Indo-Pak journalists by acting as a mediating third party.</narrative>
  </description>
